WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:05.340
If you've ever watched Showtime's comedy-drama
series "Shameless," you know the Gallaghers'

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.589
lives are far from ordinary.

00:00:07.589 --> 00:00:12.290
Each character tends to end up in some unfortunate
situation that takes an entire village to

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:13.290
correct.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:17.449
Whether it's Carl selling guns at school,
Fiona hitting her mother's corpse before her

00:00:17.449 --> 00:00:21.949
funeral, or Frank losing his son in a bet,
taking an Alzheimer's patient hostage, or

00:00:21.949 --> 00:00:27.109
intentionally killing a woman with a heart
condition, "Shameless" is filled with controversial

00:00:27.109 --> 00:00:28.359
content.

00:00:28.359 --> 00:00:33.120
Many viewers clearly found the jaw-dropping
activities depicted in "Shameless" entertaining,

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:38.820
as evidenced by the fact that the show ran
for 134 episodes across 11 seasons before

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.820
its finale in April 2021.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:44.260
However, plenty of fans didn't love every
episode.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:49.300
Some long-time viewers found certain storylines
absolutely disgusting, and many more have

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.990
said that the show crossed the line on a number
of occasions.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:57.190
Examples of "Shameless" moments that left
viewers uneasy and even outraged include Veronica

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:01.690
convincing her mother to sleep with her boyfriend
so she could have a child for them and Frank

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:04.879
making his own son Carl believe that he has
cancer.

00:01:04.879 --> 00:01:08.560
Of course, there are many more over-the-top
"Shameless" moments that we won't get into

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:09.560
here.

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:10.560
"Debbie stole a baby.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.460
We have to figure out how to return it."

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:18.560
But many fans believe one scene in the Season
4 episode "There's the Rub" went way too far.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:22.229
In the episode, it's Fiona's birthday, which
should be a joyous celebration.

00:01:22.229 --> 00:01:27.840
However, this is Fiona Gallagher we're talking
about, so there's bound to be some drama involved.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:32.549
Her boyfriend Mike ends up dumping her because
she's having an affair with his brother Robbie.

00:01:32.549 --> 00:01:37.600
The everyday chaos of a "Shameless" episode
ensues, including fights, drinking, and partying.

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:41.789
Towards the end of the episode, Robbie gives
Fiona a birthday present: a little bag of

00:01:41.789 --> 00:01:42.789
drugs.

00:01:42.789 --> 00:01:45.439
Fiona kicks Robbie out, but leaves the bag
on the table.

00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:47.979
She eventually shares the drugs during her
party.

00:01:47.979 --> 00:01:53.200
Unfortunately, the youngest Gallagher brother,
Liam, finds the drugs and ingests some.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:57.100
Debbie finds Liam unconscious in the other
room and calls Fiona for help, but it seems

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.100
like it's too late.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.569
The young boy is passed out with white powder
all over his face.

00:02:01.569 --> 00:02:06.069
The paramedics are called, and Fiona is arrested
for child abuse and possession of an illegal

00:02:06.069 --> 00:02:07.130
substance.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:11.110
Liam ends up recovering from the overdose,
but doctors warn he may experience learning

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:13.090
disabilities moving forward.

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:16.709
Although this kind of thing isn't completely
unexpected in the series, it still doesn't

00:02:16.709 --> 00:02:18.870
make it any easier to witness.

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:23.210
Many viewers felt that this depiction of child
abuse and endangerment was too much, even

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:25.010
for a show like "Shameless."

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:29.370
Fiona's mistakes didn't start at disrespecting
her dead mother and stop at endangering her

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.519
little brother.

00:02:30.519 --> 00:02:35.069
Over the course of the series' 11 seasons,
nine of which Fiona actress Emmy Rossum starred

00:02:35.069 --> 00:02:39.510
in, she did a lot of questionable things,
and fans had no problem airing their grievances

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:40.779
about the character.

00:02:40.779 --> 00:02:46.250
One Reddit user admitted that he likes "Shameless"
but finds the Gallagher family terrible — particularly

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.720
Fiona, for a number of reasons.

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:48.720
The Redditor wrote…

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:50.070
"Fiona is ridiculous.

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:54.339
She's cheated on pretty much all of her boyfriends
and is controlling of everyone around her.

00:02:54.339 --> 00:02:57.939
[...] The only thing she did that could be
considered good is raising her siblings and

00:02:57.939 --> 00:03:01.209
even then she has to lord it over anyone who
will listen.

00:03:01.209 --> 00:03:04.470
And she never seems to show remorse for what
she does."

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:08.301
"I'm not just chaos."

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.989
Another viewer and Redditor pointed out that
when Rossum left "Shameless," it brought Fiona's

00:03:13.989 --> 00:03:16.879
core storyline to an end at the perfect moment.

00:03:16.879 --> 00:03:20.239
"Fiona left at the right place and the right
time IMO.

00:03:20.239 --> 00:03:23.040
Her role as acting guardian was more or less
fulfilled.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:26.970
By the time she asks Ian for permission to
leave, it's strikingly obvious that she is

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.209
no longer needed."

00:03:28.209 --> 00:03:30.760
Not all "Shameless" fans feel this way, of
course.

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:34.640
Even in the face of all Fiona has done wrong,
plenty of viewers still think she deserves

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:38.609
a lot of credit for doing all she could to
take care of her family.

00:03:38.609 --> 00:03:39.769
One Redditor wrote...

00:03:39.769 --> 00:03:43.959
"Fiona gets so much s--- but I think she is
one of the best characters in the show.

00:03:43.959 --> 00:03:48.100
She's got the most empathy out of all the
Gallaghers for her family and will do anything

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.780
to help them whenever they need it.

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:54.640
She deserves the world despite her awful mistakes
with her significant others and Liam."

